Package: veltos-wine-addons
Architecture: all
Depends: wine (>= 10.0~), wine (<< 10.1~), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wine Mono and Wine Gecko for VeltOS
 Wine needs Wine Mono to run .NET Framework programs and Wine Gecko to show
 web content inside Windows programs. Debian's Wine disables the automatic
 download of these components, so many programs would fail. This package
 provides the exact versions Wine 10.0 expects (Mono 9.4.0, Gecko 2.47.4)
 in /usr/share/wine/, where Wine installs them into each new Windows
 environment without any download.
 .
 The installers are the official WineHQ builds, pinned by SHA-256 (the same
 checksums Wine itself verifies).
